-2. Set the redirect URI in your identity provider to LearnHouse's [callback URL](/enterprise/sso#callback-url), which ends in `/api/v1/auth/sso/callback`.
+2. Set the redirect URI in your identity provider to LearnHouse's [callback URL](/enterprise/sso#callback-url), which ends in `/auth/sso/callback`.
 3. In LearnHouse, go to **Developers** → **SSO** and choose **Custom OIDC** as the **SSO Provider**.
